This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The wire format (UDP port 41463, 8-byte ASCII prefixes, little-endian float32
payloads), the prefix/field table and the eye-openness formula were informed
by the ALVR server source
(alvr/server_core/src/tracking/face.rs of https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR,
MIT-style license) and by the VRCFT module VRCFT-ALVR
(https://github.com/alvr-org/VRCFT-ALVR, Apache License 2.0); expression field
orderings were cross-checked against the Khronos OpenXR registry
(XR_FB_face_tracking2, XR_HTC_facial_tracking, XR_BD_facial_simulation).
This repository is an independent C++ implementation of that wire format and
contains none of their source code.

